+- **Number:** On DTU scan 40 with false geometry, the percentage of loss value in the false geometry region (normalized [0,1]) for various losses: Background entropy loss (11.0%), Photometric loss (11.1%), Per-point RGB loss (12.4%), CF loss (6.5%), Ray-entropy loss (4.7%), Distortion loss (28.0%) [S4].
